{"articleNo":"2352","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2352&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"등록금 분할납부 4차분 납부 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.04","hit":"13570","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"94%\" border=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td><span class=\"style3\">\n            <p><font color=\"#333333\" size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong><font color=\"#9933ff\"><font color=\"#333333\">등록금 분할납부</font> <u><font color=\"#ff0000\">4차분</font></u> </font><font color=\"#333333\">납부 안내</font></strong></font></p>\n            <p><font color=\"#333333\" size=\"2\"><br>1. 납부기간 :&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\"><font size=\"2\"><u><strong><font color=\"#3366ff\">2009.11.16.(월)~11.17.(화)<br></font></strong></u><br>2. 납부장소 : </font></font><font color=\"#333333\"><font size=\"2\"><strong><u><font color=\"#3366ff\">농협중앙회 금오공대지점(글로벌관 128호)</font></u>&nbsp;<br></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(타지점 및 타은행에서 납부 불가)&nbsp;<br><br>3. 고지서 발급<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 분할납부 신청시 발급받은 고지서로 납부 가능<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 분실시 경리팀에서 발급 가능(글로벌관 533호)<br><br>4. 기타사항<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 분할납부는 반드시 정해진 납부기간에 납부하여야 함<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 휴학시에는 등록금을 완납하여야 함</font><br><br><br><br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font><font color=\"#333333\"><font size=\"3\">2009.11.04.<br></font><br><br><strong><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;총무과장</font></strong></font></p>\n            </spa